---
const guarantees = [
  {
    title: 'Device Key in the Keychain',
    body: 'An Ed25519 Device Key is generated on device during QR pairing; the private key stays in the Keychain, and the Pairing Code pins the host key fingerprint.',
  },
  {
    title: 'End-to-end encrypted notifications',
    body: 'APNs pushes fire when an Agent goes Blocked or Done and deep-link into its terminal. The relay sees the device token, source IP, request timing, and ciphertext — but cannot read the notification.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Verified at both hops',
    body: `Behind a Jump Host, host keys are verified independently at each hop. The recommended deployment keeps the reverse-forwarded port on the VPS loopback interface instead of publishing the Mac's SSH port.`,
  },
  {
    title: 'No new surface area',
    body: `No herdr server changes and no extra packages. The Host's SSH server must permit stream-local forwarding, which is the OpenSSH default; onboarding says so when it is turned off.`,
  },
];
---

<section id="security" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Security</div>
    <h2 class="section-title title">Keys stay on device. The relay reads nothing.</h2>
    <ul class="grid">
      {
        guarantees.map((item) => (
          <li class="card">
            <h3 class="card-title">{item.title}</h3>
            <p class="card-body">{item.body}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .title {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--sp-6);
    margin: 56px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .card {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--r-card);
    background: var(--surface-card);
    padding: var(--sp-8);
  }

  .card-title {
    font: var(--type-h4);
  }

  .card-body {
    font: var(--type-body-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-top: var(--sp-2-5);
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--sp-4);
      margin-top: 40px;
    }

    .card {
      padding: var(--sp-6);
    }
  }
</style>
